d","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெடையொடு","parts":[{"text":"பெடை","lemma":"பெடை","gloss":"female bird"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the female bird"},{"surface":"பயிரி","parts":[{"text":"பயிர்","lemma":"பயிர்","gloss":"call"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having called"},{"surface":"இன்புற","parts":[{"text":"இன்பு","lemma":"இன்பு","gloss":"pleasure"},{"text":"உற","lemma":"உறு","gloss":"to experience"}],"gloss":"to rejoice"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இமைக்கண்","parts":[{"text":"இமை","lemma":"இமை","gloss":"blink"},{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"place"}],"gloss":"in the blink of an eye"},{"surface":"ஏதாகின்றோ","parts":[{"text":"ஏது","lemma":"ஏது","gloss":"what"},{"text":"ஆகின்று","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"interrogative particle"}],"gloss":"what has it become?"},{"surface":"ஞெமை","parts":[{"text":"ஞெமை","lemma":"ஞெமை","gloss":"ñemai tree"}],"gloss":"ñemai tree"},{"surface":"தலை","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"top"}],"gloss":"top"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஊனசைஇ","parts":[{"text":"ஊன்","lemma":"ஊன்","gloss":"flesh"},{"text":"அசைஇ","lemma":"அசை","gloss":"desiring"}],"gloss":"desiring flesh"},{"surface":"ஒரு","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"a"},{"surface":"பருந்து","parts":[{"text":"பருந்து","lemma":"பருந்து","gloss":"vulture"}],"gloss":"vulture"},{"surface":"இருக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"இருக்கும்","lemma":"இருக்கும்","gloss":"that sits"}],"gloss":"that sits","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வான்","parts":[{"text":"வான்","lemma":"வான்","gloss":"sky"}],"gloss":"sky"},{"surface":"உயர்","parts":[{"text":"உயர்","lemma":"உயர்","gloss":"high"}],"gloss":"high"},{"surface":"பிறங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"பிறங்கல்","lemma":"பிறங்கல்","gloss":"mountain peak"}],"gloss":"mountain peak"},{"surface":"மலை","parts":[{"text":"மலை","lemma":"மலை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"mountain"},{"surface":"இறந்தோரே","parts":[{"text":"இறந்து","lemma":"இற","gloss":"cross"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"he who"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"he who crossed indeed"}]}],"literal":"Day after day, even as days pass, he does not come / At all times, even in the daytime, he does not appear / Where is he, oh friend? Here, is this / the season he promised? Many times / calling out to its grey-backed female to rejoice / what has happened in the blink of an eye? On the top of the ñemai tree / desiring flesh, a single vulture sits / on the sky-high rising mountain peak, he who crossed.","translation":"Day after day, even as days pass, he does not return. At all times, he does not appear. Where is he, my friend? Is this indeed the season he promised? Many times, calling out to its grey-backed mate to rejoice, a vulture sits on the top of a ñemai tree, desiring flesh, on the sky-high rising mountain peak that he crossed.","modern":"நாளுக்கு நாள் நாட்கள் கழிந்தாலும் அவர் வரவில்லை. எல்லா நேரங்களிலும் அவர் தோன்றவில்லை. தோழியே! அவர் எங்கே இருக்கிறாரோ? அவர் திரும்பி வருவதாகச் சொல்லிச் சென்ற பருவம் இதுதானோ? சாம்பல் நிற முதுகைக் கொண்ட தன் பெண் பறவையை அழைத்து மகிழ்விப்பதற்காக, இமைக்கும் நேரத்திற்குள் என்ன ஆயிற்றோ? ஞெமை மரத்தின் உச்சியில் தசைக்காகக் காத்திருக்கும் ஒரு பருந்து அமர்ந்திருக்கும், வானளவு உயர்ந்த மலைகளைக் கடந்து சென்றவர் அவர்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the pālai (wasteland) landscape, where the theme is the separation of lovers. The heroine is speaking to her close friend, expressing her deep grief and anxiety over the hero's delayed return. He had promised to return by a specific season, but that season has arrived and he is still missing. She describes the harsh, dry path he crossed, featuring a vulture sitting atop a ñemai tree waiting for flesh. This image of the vulture calling its mate to share in its joy contrasts sharply with the heroine's own state of lonely longing. The key words include 'vaikal' (day), 'paruvam' (season), and 'paruntu' (vulture), which emphasize the passage of time and the desolate environment.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.4],[1.4,1.5],[1.5,2.5],[2.5,2.71],[2.79,3.0],[3.0,3.6],[3.6,4.5],[4.5,4.9],[4.9,5.1],[5.3,5.4],[5.6,6.5],[6.5,6.9],[6.9,7.0],[7.0,7.9],[7.9,8.2],[8.2,8.2],[8.2,8.5],[8.5,10.45],[10.45,11.45],[11.45,11.45],[11.45,11.7],[11.7,12.45],[12.45,12.78],[12.86,13.59],[13.59,14.0],[14.0,14.8],[14.8,15.2],[15.2,15.5],[15.5,15.6]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.6],[1.6,2.5],[2.5,2.75],[2.85,3.1],[3.1,3.8],[3.8,4.8],[4.8,5.4],[5.4,5.6],[5.75,6.2],[6.2,6.8],[6.8,7.3],[7.3,7.4],[7.4,7.7],[7.7,7.7],[7.7,9.8],[9.8,10.4],[10.47,10.8],[11.7,12.0],[12.0,12.06],[12.06,12.39],[12.56,13.1],[13.4,14.0],[14.13,14.7],[14.7,15.2],[15.2,16.1],[16.1,16.4],[16.4,16.8],[16.8,16.9]]}}